                            <span class="industry-tag" style="color: var(--accent-gold); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.15em; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 600; display: block; margin-bottom: 15px;">Luxury Growth</span>
                            <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 24px; font-weight: 300; margin-bottom: 20px; color: white;">Premium D2C Saree & Ethnicwear Brands</h3>
                            <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 25px;">For modern designer boutiques and high-scale online saree stores aiming for hyper-growth. We deploy hyper-optimized conversion layouts and AI performance ads targeting high-ticket bridal buyers globally.</p>
                        </div>
                        <ul class="industry-bullets" style="list-style: none; padding: 0;">
                            <li style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-dim); margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;"><span style="color: var(--accent-gold);">•</span> 12x+ ROAS Paid Campaign Architectures</li>
                            <li style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-dim); margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;"><span style="color: var(--accent-gold);">•</span> NRI Global Checkout & Multi-Currency Systems</li>
                            <li style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-dim); margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;"><span style="color: var(--accent-gold);">•</span> VIP WhatsApp Loyalty Funnels</li>
