                            <li style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-dim); margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;"><span style="color: var(--accent-gold);">•</span> High-Authority Lead Generation engines</li>
                            <li style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-dim); margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;"><span style="color: var(--accent-gold);">•</span> Digital Cataloguing & Video Audits</li>
