                        <p style="font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--text-secondary); margin: 0;">We are obsessed with return. We build metrics-driven architectures designed to maximize profit.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="glass-panel-anatomy principle-card" style="padding: 40px; border-radius: 24px;">
                        <span class="principle-num" style="font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 32px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent-gold); display: block; margin-bottom: 15px;">03</span>
                        <h4 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 20px; color: white; margin-bottom: 10px;">Cinematic Depth</h4>
                        <p style="font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--text-secondary); margin: 0;">No basic stock photos. We shoot premium, customized editorial visuals in Varanasi's ghats.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="glass-panel-anatomy principle-card" style="padding: 40px; border-radius: 24px;">
                        <span class="principle-num" style="font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 32px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent-gold); display: block; margin-bottom: 15px;">04</span>
                        <h4 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 20px; color: white; margin-bottom: 10px;">Infinite Innovation</h4>
                        <p style="font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--text-secondary); margin: 0;">From AI-driven WhatsApp models to global multi-currency hubs, we continuously iterate.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

    <!-- ==================== 3. BLOGS & ARTICLE PAGE ==================== -->
